                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16265217" author="ptupitsyn" created="Fri, 24 Nov 2017 12:13:24 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;MacOS dlopen should look like this:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
            [DllImport(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;libSystem.dylib&quot;&lt;/span&gt;)]
            internal &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;static&lt;/span&gt; extern IntPtr dlopen(string filename, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; flags);
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16265265" author="githubbot" created="Fri, 24 Nov 2017 13:08:35 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user ptupitsyn opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/3091&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/3091&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7013&quot; title=&quot;.NET: Ignite does not start on macOS&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-7013&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-7013&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; .NET: Fix startup on macOS (dlopen call)&lt;/p&gt;



&lt;p&gt;You can merge this pull request into a Git repository by running:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    $ git pull &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ptupitsyn/ignite&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/ptupitsyn/ignite&lt;/a&gt; ignite-7013&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Alternatively you can review and apply these changes as the patch at:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/3091.patch&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/3091.patch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To close this pull request, make a commit to your master/trunk branch&lt;br/&gt;
with (at least) the following in the commit message:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    This closes #3091&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;commit 071010551e3cde09e206c168408f13a3c15e615e&lt;br/&gt;
Author: Pavel Tupitsyn &amp;lt;ptupitsyn@apache.org&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Date:   2017-11-24T13:06:10Z&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7013&quot; title=&quot;.NET: Ignite does not start on macOS&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-7013&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-7013&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; .NET: Ignite does not start on macOS&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16265352" author="ptupitsyn" created="Fri, 24 Nov 2017 15:01:57 +0000"  >&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;jvm.dll&lt;/tt&gt; is &lt;tt&gt;libjvm.dylib&lt;/tt&gt; on macOs.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;lookup path is something like &lt;tt&gt;/Library/Java/JavaVirtualMachines/jdk1.8.0_121.jdk/Contents/Home/jre/lib/server/libjvm.dylib&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="16266734" author="ptupitsyn" created="Mon, 27 Nov 2017 12:29:19 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;LoadLibrary&lt;/tt&gt; + &lt;tt&gt;DllImport&lt;/tt&gt; combo does not work on macOs (where &lt;tt&gt;LoadLibrary&lt;/tt&gt; is called with a full path, and &lt;tt&gt;DllImport&lt;/tt&gt; uses simple name).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We have to switch to &lt;tt&gt;dlopen&lt;/tt&gt; + &lt;tt&gt;dlsym&lt;/tt&gt; and manual delegate creation.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16266924" author="ptupitsyn" created="Mon, 27 Nov 2017 15:15:54 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Very &quot;fun&quot; bug: &lt;a href=&quot;https://bugs.openjdk.java.net/browse/JDK-7131356&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://bugs.openjdk.java.net/browse/JDK-7131356&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Users may have to update Java to certain version or install Java 6.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16266948" author="ptupitsyn" created="Mon, 27 Nov 2017 15:31:48 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Finally was able to start Ignite.NET on macOS Sierra:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;libjvm.dylib support added&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;DllImport&lt;/tt&gt; refactored to &lt;tt&gt;dlopen&lt;/tt&gt; + &lt;tt&gt;dlsym&lt;/tt&gt; calls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Will add separate JAVA_HOME resolving code by looking into &lt;tt&gt;/Library/Java/JavaVirtualMachines/&lt;/tt&gt; folder.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16268207" author="ptupitsyn" created="Tue, 28 Nov 2017 06:32:12 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Thin client tests failed on macOs: setting socket buffer size to 0 throws an error there. Fixed that by skipping socket setting update when defaults are set.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16268925" author="ptupitsyn" created="Tue, 28 Nov 2017 15:32:41 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;TC is fine, merged to master: &lt;tt&gt;0b849abce4514ffe949915c85b15ad6aae23ee33&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16268927" author="githubbot" created="Tue, 28 Nov 2017 15:34:45 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user asfgit closed the pull request at:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/3091&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/3091&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
